        "default_language": "en",
        "values": {
          "en": "The shift ↑ᵈ_c a increases every bound-variable index k ≥ c by d. Crossing a binder raises the cutoff from c to c+1; application is traversed componentwise. This operation is the lift used when substitution crosses a binder.",
